What is Carotenoid Microcapsule?
Carotenoid microcapsules enable manufacturers to incorporate biologically active pigments into a wide range of products while preserving stability and functionality. The micro‑encapsulation process creates a protective barrier around the carotenoid molecules, shielding them from degradation caused by light, heat and oxygen. This technology also allows precise dosing, which is essential for meeting regulatory limits and delivering health‑related claims such as eye‑health support, skin‑health benefits and overall antioxidant activity.
